From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Caboose <caboose@invalid>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 32/32] Offer VK_EXT_robustness2 when the device has it

DXVK 2 requires VK_EXT_robustness2 (robustBufferAccess2 and nullDescriptor) and
fails to create a D3D11 device without it. The encoder already marshals its
feature and property structures; the extension was only missing from the guest's
device extension allowlist, which offers an extension only when the phone's
device supports it.
---
 src/gfxstream/guest/vulkan_enc/ResourceTracker.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/gfxstream/guest/vulkan_enc/ResourceTracker.cpp b/src/gfxstream/guest/vulkan_enc/ResourceTracker.cpp
index 3733ef6..7c4c31a 100644
--- a/src/gfxstream/guest/vulkan_enc/ResourceTracker.cpp
+++ b/src/gfxstream/guest/vulkan_enc/ResourceTracker.cpp
@@ -2233,6 +2233,7 @@ VkResult ResourceTracker::on_vkEnumerateDeviceExtensionProperties(
         "VK_KHR_zero_initialize_workgroup_memory",
         "VK_EXT_4444_formats",
         "VK_EXT_extended_dynamic_state",
+        "VK_EXT_robustness2",
         "VK_EXT_extended_dynamic_state2",
         "VK_EXT_inline_uniform_block",
         "VK_EXT_pipeline_creation_cache_control",
-- 
